<span class="eyebrow">Services</span>
<h1>Kitchen design in Toronto and Vaughan</h1>
<p>A kitchen is the most used room in the house and the one with the most decisions: layout, cabinetry, counters, appliances, lighting and storage. Renotect designs kitchens around how you cook and live, shows you the result in 3D before anything is ordered, and follows the installation on site.</p>
<div class="cta" style="margin-top:28px"><a class="btn" href="/#contact">Book a free consultation</a><a class="btn alt" href="/projects/maple-modern-kitchen/">See the Maple Modern Kitchen</a></div>
</div></section>

