<div class="sec-head"><div><span class="eyebrow">What is included</span>
<h2>Every detail planned before it is built</h2></div></div>
<ol class="svc">
<li><span class="n">01</span><h3>Layout</h3><p>Work zones, island and seating, clearances and circulation planned around how you cook.</p></li>
<li><span class="n">02</span><h3>Cabinetry and millwork</h3><p>Cabinets, pantry and built-ins designed in detail, so a cabinet maker can price and build them accurately.</p></li>
<li><span class="n">03</span><h3>Materials and finishes</h3><p>Counters, backsplash, flooring, hardware and colours brought together on one concept board.</p></li>
<li><span class="n">04</span><h3>Appliances and lighting</h3><p>Appliance specs and clearances checked before ordering, with layered lighting for cooking and evenings.</p></li>
<li><span class="n">05</span><h3>3D renders</h3><p>You see the finished kitchen before anything is ordered or demolished.</p></li>
<li><span class="n">06</span><h3>Installation on site</h3><p>We follow the installation so the kitchen is built the way it was designed.</p></li>
</ol>
</div></section>

